    "against a green gate, which is what the script was written for.",
    "The paths are real facts about THIS tree, deliberately. src/handlers.rs exists only under",
    "mcp-server, so it resolves; Cargo.toml exists at the root and in both members, so it is ambiguous.",
    "If the workspace is restructured this fixture goes red, which is correct - knowing where the files",
    "are is the script whole job."
